# Apify API token — used as the fallback data source when the direct fetch
# (stage 1, always attempted first) fails or returns no reviews. Free trial
# credit available at apify.com; Settings -> Integrations for your token.
# Without this set, listings the direct fetch can't handle will just error.
APIFY_TOKEN=

# Vercel Postgres connection vars (POSTGRES_URL etc.) — set automatically
# when you provision a Postgres database for this project in the Vercel
# dashboard (Storage tab). Needed for the Save/Projects feature.
